error[E0050]: 'map<i64, i64>()' takes zero arguments or one capacity hint, got 3
 --> check_map_ctor_multi_arg.bit:9:11
  |
9 |   let m = map<i64, i64>(1, 2, 3)
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 'map<i64, i64>()' is empty, 'map<i64, i64>(n)' pre-sizes for about n entries — build entries with a map literal `map<i64, i64>{ ... }` instead (§12.3, §12.9)
